  </author>
  <description>
	SMART/Saxion "Mini-Tilt Drone": over-actuated hexarotor, 6 tilting arms
	(1 rotor + 1 tilt servo each). Meshes generated from the "Tiltrotor V1"
	STEP assembly: arm radius 0.1753 m, 5x4x3 props, Emax ECO II 2306 1700KV.
	Matches PX4 airframe 25006_gazebo-classic_mini_tilt_hexa.
  </description>
</model>
